# If a read times out, the server places this line:
# Battery DEAD
# We may also have lines like this:
# 05-18-2026 19:41:13 18 0 BAD BAD BAD

# There is also chatter like this,
# Listening on port 2001
# as well as comments prefixed with #
# A good bet is just to check if the first
# character is numeric.

# the timestamp (date/time) are added by the receiving server

# Fields are:
#  date
#  time
#  delay since last reading
#  battery voltage
#  humidity
